WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:07,040
You have entered my territory

2
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,040
Don't be angry

3
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:10,040
We are just here to find our little brother

4
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:13,040
Jian indeed said that he was haunted by a Qipin Tanglang.

5
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:16,230
Your little brother has been eaten by me

6
00:00:16,230 --> 00:00:17,230
How can that be done?

7
00:00:17,230 --> 00:00:19,230
Jian indeed said that Tang Lang was only Qipin

8
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:20,230
You are already a wine

9
00:00:20,230 --> 00:00:22,230
How could it be you?

10
00:00:22,230 --> 00:00:24,230
Even if I talk to you for a long time, I still can’t understand it.

11
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:26,230
I'd better send you down

12
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:27,230
Ask him yourself

13
00:00:27,230 --> 00:00:48,390
why go

14
00:00:48,390 --> 00:00:54,880
There's a hungry demon here who can't get enough to eat.

15
00:00:54,880 --> 00:00:55,880
Hungry demon who can’t get enough to eat

16
00:00:55,880 --> 00:01:00,290
It's probably me you're talking about.

17
00:01:00,290 --> 00:01:01,290
Arriving at Qipin soon

18
00:01:01,290 --> 00:01:10,910
It’s time to explore the core area.

19
00:01:10,910 --> 00:01:11,910
If I die outside

20
00:01:11,910 --> 00:01:13,910
Wouldn't he be locked in and starve to death?

21
00:01:13,910 --> 00:01:15,620
I'm dead

22
00:01:15,620 --> 00:01:17,620
I don’t care if he’s hungry or not.
